  "qualifications": [
    "WebKit serializes unicode-range in lowercase hexadecimal (U+0-10ffff); Chromium in uppercase.",
    "WebKit FontFaceSet.check is true for an unloaded URL face it does not load; Chromium is false. Neither starts the load.",
    "A family holding U+0000 reads back as the escaped CSS string \"Rv\\0 Nul\" in WebKit; Chromium keeps the raw NUL. The family reaches the engine whole, so the transport is length-delimited.",
    "The engine accepts a face built in another document or host into a document's set (FontFaceSet.add); rv_font_face_load on such a face from the wrong host is RV_ERR_WRONG_HOST, and on a replaced document RV_ERR_DETACHED.",
    "FontFaceSet construction, its load and ready promises and on* handlers stay out of the generated surface; T01 rv_fonts_* cover load, ready and events for document.fonts.",
    "The metric-override descriptors (ascentOverride, descentOverride, lineGapOverride) are attributes only; FontFaceDescriptors leaves its setting-gated fields out.",
    "TTF, CFF OTF, WOFF and WOFF2 load from bytes on win-x64 as in Chromium; other ports report through the CI probe."
  ],
